{
	title: 'Expose tools as an ordered array',
	spec: 'tools.all() returns Tool[] in built-in filename order instead of a Map keyed by the redundant tool name. Plugins extend or reorder the result through existing around hooks, for example next => [...next(), myTool]; the example plugin teaches this pattern. Existing hook composition order stays unchanged. Callers use array lookup and iteration for parsing, execution, read-only scheduling, HELP, prompt summaries and provider search fallback. No cache, secondary registry or new registration API is added.',
